# OS       TRIPLET                  ARCH          TIMEOUT
macos      x86_64-apple-darwin      x86_64        .

# These special lines allow us to embed default values for the columns above.
# Any column without a default mapping here will simply substitute a `.` to the empty string

# Intel macOS is listed apart from the other platforms because a pull request
# into master tests it only when it changes JuliaC or trimming (JULIAC_PATHS in
# utilities/render_launch_pipeline.py).
# The x86_64 Mac minis have run past 45 minutes while still making progress.
#default TIMEOUT 60
